# The VPS image is built from the whole repo (deploy/Dockerfile: COPY . .).
# Secrets must never end up inside it: Next copies .env.production into the
# standalone build, so the image would carry the database password, LINE
# tokens and the staff PIN. The running container gets them from env_file.
.env*
!.env.example
backups
.git
node_modules
.next
apps/staff-desktop/src-tauri/target
apps/staff-desktop/dist
docs/PRODUCTION_READINESS_REVIEW.md
